pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: header
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 66, 400, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      fontFamily: LXGW Bright
      color: "$gray"
      letterSpacing: 4
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 寻找异常值 · 引子
  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 104, 56, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: quote
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 300, 800, 420]
    content:
      fontSize: 38
      fontFamily: LXGW Bright
      color: "$body"
      lineHeight: 2.1
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>在生活中增添<span style="color:$red">「异常值」</span>，</p>
        <p>让我探索新的可能；</p>
        <p>在生活中习惯<span style="color:$red">「回归值」</span>，</p>
        <p>让我死在本地最优解。</p>
  - elementId: quote-src
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 760, 800, 32]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      fontFamily: LXGW Bright
      color: "$gray"
      wrap: false
      align: [right, middle]
      text: —— 播客《无人知晓》E42 · 沉默的主角
  - elementId: intro
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 880, 800, 180]
    content:
      fontSize: 25
      fontFamily: LXGW Bright
      color: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.9
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>作为一名数仓工程师，我的工作常被形容为"和冰冷的数字对话"。过去我说：把没法用的数据加工成大家看得懂的东西，很有成就感。</p>
        <p>但现在，我有了更深一层的答案。</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [760, 1190, 120, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      fontFamily: LXGW Bright
      color: "$gray"
      wrap: false
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 03 / 10
